><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:8pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">.</span></ix:footnote></div></div><div class="item-list-element-wrapper" style="display:flex;margin-top:0;justify-content:flex-start;align-items:baseline;margin-bottom:0;min-width:4%;text-align:justify;"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:8pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:4%;word-break:keep-all;display:inline-flex;justify-content:flex-start;">(3)</span><div style="display:inline;"><ix:footnote id="FNT_54835604-4813-4fec-99d7-1a8b01d9667d" xml:lang="en-US"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:8pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">Allowance for credit loss </span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:8pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">as a percent of gross loans held for investment and excludes loans held for sale.</span></ix:footnote></div></div><div class="item-list-element-wrapper" style="display:flex;margin-top:0;justify-content:flex-start;align-items:baseline;margin-bottom:0;min-width:4%;text-align:justify;"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:8pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:4%;word-break:keep-all;display:inline-flex;justify-content:flex-start;">(4)</span><div style="display:inline;"><ix:footnote id="FNT_c4d361ca-3d2b-473d-8260-c6780317a52b" xml:lang="en-US"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:8pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">Loans </span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:8pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">90 days or more past due as a percent of total loans.</span></ix:footnote></div></div><div class="item-list-element-wrapper" style="display:flex;margin-top:0;justify-content:flex-start;align-item